    "text": {
     "en": "A mirror shows a reflection, also called a mirror image.\nThe left side appears on the right. Letters like A, H and I look the same; letters like R or S change.\nDraw the mirror image of a shape by drawing it the same distance on the other side of the mirror line.\nA symmetric pattern is the same on both sides of a mirror line."
    }
